# Local Request and Speech Diagnostics

Status: DONE
Milestone: Q4 Observable local failures
Dependencies: None

## Purpose

Make backend stages and failures inspectable without silently recording conversations or leaking credentials.

## Tasks

- [x] Add bounded nonblocking rotating app JSONL logs with request/capture correlation.
- [x] Record startup/config/error, audio level/clipping, transcript counts and answer-stage timings.
- [x] Record safe exception type/method information without raw exception messages.
- [x] Add explicit text opt-in, metadata-only summary and safe local export scripts.
- [x] Integrate backend model/decode metrics and document their distinct clock/identity semantics.
- [x] Exercise rotation, drops, IO failures, UI reporting and actual request lifecycle coverage.
- [x] Update source/package documentation and retain a clear statement about unavailable historical logs.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Logging starts automatically in the updated app; no false claim of retroactive traces.
- [x] No raw audio, notes, tokens, provider stderr or conversation text in default logs.
- [x] Text content is explicit local opt-in; export excludes it by default and never uploads.
- [x] Missing/dropped logs are visible, not silently reported as complete diagnostics.

## Completion evidence

- Four initial logger cases pass. Old workspace speech log had zero bytes and completed Agency request
  directories had been deleted; the reported old interaction cannot be reconstructed from them.
- AppmetadataJSONL rotates2MiBx10,queue1024; capture/request correlation, ASRcounts/RMS/clipping,
  provider/firsttext/UIassignment/terminal/cleanup and safe exception frames are present.
- Backendlogs rotate1MiBplus3backups and use their actual metadata-only schema. They contain no
  app correlationID; correlate UTC/source/stage cautiously, not by inventing shared identifiers.
- Explicit Set-Diagnostics -Mode Text retains finaltranscript/question/answer locally, never audio,
  notes/tokens/providerstderr. Show-Diagnostics excludesui_fixture by default; Export-Diagnostics
  stripsTextbydefault and includes only four allowlisted workspace speechlogs. Nothing uploads.
- Parentexportverification observed1979app+1speech records with noText. Docs/package tooling adds
  DIAGNOSTICS.md and allthree diagnostic script/txtpairs; final assertions are in IMPLEMENTATION-STATUS.md.

